   },
   {
    "label": "Week 6",
    "text": "Data analysis and insight generation."
   },
   {
    "label": "Week 7",
    "text": "Visual encoding of data."
   },
   {
    "label": "Week 8",
    "text": "Design principles and heuristics for effective visualization."
   },
   {
    "label": "Week 9",
    "text": "Data Stories"
   },
   {
